not long after Bloody Sunday.

224
00:10:49.191 --> 00:10:50.984
They found
this wee sadistic prick

225
00:10:51.068 --> 00:10:52.819
to try and stop our movement.

226
00:10:54.988 --> 00:10:57.324
He implemented
aggressive house searches.

227
00:10:57.407 --> 00:10:59.076
