to the cause in my eyes.

234
00:11:18.261 --> 00:11:19.930
He arrives next month
on the 14th.

235
00:11:20.013 --> 00:11:22.173
and he's being given an award
at the British Consulate.

236
00:11:23.433 --> 00:11:25.143
It's like they're
throwing it in our faces.

237
00:11:25.227 --> 00:11:27.896
The more Irish Catholics
they kill. the bigger the prize.

238
00:11:27.979 --> 00:11:31.024
Aye. They want the world
to think that black is white.

239
00:11:31.108 --> 00:11:33.151
up is down.

240
00:11:33.235 --> 00:11:35.362
Want to rewrite the narrative.

241
00:11:35.445 --> 00:11:37.864
bury British crimes.

242
00:11:37.948 --> 00:11:40.158
And it's up to us. mo chairde.

243
00:11:40.242 --> 00:11:42.744
to give the world
a wee dose of reality.

244
00:11:45.831 --> 00:11:49.334
Now. the Consulate is
on 48th and Second.

245
00:11:49.418 --> 00:11:51.336
We're gonna put the car
right at the entrance.

246
00:11:51.420 --> 00:11:54.214
and we're gonna blow this
motherfucker to smithereens.

247
00:11:54.297 --> 00:11:56.925
This is why you wanted
the rocket launcher.

248
00:11:57.008 --> 00:11:59.219
And now that's gone...

249
00:11:59.302 --> 00:12:01.179
