250
00:12:01.263 --> 00:12:02.806
Semtex.

251
00:12:02.889 --> 00:12:04.391
A car bomb?

252
00:12:04.474 --> 00:12:06.309
No. no. I don't know
about that. Brendan.

253
00:12:06.393 --> 00:12:09.187
I'm the leader of this cell.
it's my decision.

254
00:12:09.271 --> 00:12:11.106
Now. if we're lucky.
